[Options]

[A.]
                                   <i>~[IrainWalker.C4]</i> RESCUE THE ALLIES<i>~[IsunWalker.C1]</i><br>
<i>But, fellow Nimbians, we don't have to fight!<br>
                                                                                  --mosquito
<br>
<i>Not fight? But what would we do to pass the day?<br>
                                                                                  --fellow Nimbian</i>
<p>
Oh no! A major setback. The Furies have promised revenge, and they are about to get it
All four Furies have combined together and united to destroy your band of rebels...
<p>
Unfortunately for you, they have captured a band of your followers known as SNOB
(<i>S</i>killed <i>N</i>imbians <i>O</i>f the <i>B</i>rotherhood), and are holding them
captive, waiting for you to try and rescue them. There, they will squash you like the
pest that you have been to them.
<p>
When you are crushed and defeated, they feel Nimbus will go back to its old ways of chaos
and war.
<p>
Stand up to the Furies! Prove them wrong! Save your SNOB followers!


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0





[ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Wet my Whistle!</h2>
<p>
Ebb and flow...<br>
Ebb and flow...<br>
I have tasted many victories...<br>
Now I am to taste defeat....

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Splash</h2>
<p>
Rain pours from the skies, as one<br>
of the students of RAIN perishes


[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Wind Warrior</h2>
<p>
You may take my body, but my soul<br>
will still be free as the wind...<br>
And my Brothers of the wind will<br>
fight on....

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>YMessage from the Wind Fury</h2>
<p>
Somewhere in the distance, you hear a long<br>
and lonesome wail...<br>

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Boom! Boom!</h2>
<p>
Impossible, just like my brother Boom!, I may be<br>
defeated... How can this be?

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Thunder Lord!</h2>
<p>
A huge sound of thunder explodes from the sky<br>
above you, and in a voice that sends shivers<br>
down your spine, you hear...<br><br>
My wrath will be heard throughout Nimbus...<br>
As your howls will echo throughout the land....<br>
You will be sacrificed upon an altar of stone!<br>
and your blood will trickle down the altar....<br>
and your flesh will rot from your bones....<br>
Then, and only then, will I have VENGENCE upon those<br>
who dare oppose my rule<br>


[ai5PriestSaved]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You've done it! You saved your allies, the SNOBs. You defeated the combined forces of thunder,
rain, and wind! Word is spreading quickly of your defiance to the
Furies. Many call you a fool, but there is a growing minority
of Nimbians that are asking you to teach them the ways of peace
and enlightenment<br>
That night, in your sleep, you review the battle you just fought
and suddenly, more technology is understood by you.....
<i>    ~[IwindBlocker] ~[IwindWalker]</i><br>
When you wake, you find that you have mastered all of the wind technology

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,unite


[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Oh no! The combined powers of wind, rain and thunder were too great for you..<br>
You cannot stop now. You must unite against anarchy and destruction

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


